<<
/Title (Users perceive ChatGPT voice as a high-stakes, "one-shot" performance that lacks the drafting safety, visual verification, and editability of typing. This makes it feel too risky and mentally taxing for serious tasks, especially when compounded by fears of accent misinterpretation and social exposure in shared environments.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 266 0 R
>>
