<<
/Title (Drives long-term retention by evolving ChatGPT from a "search box" into a seamless daily habit, capturing a larger share of the Indian mobile-first market. By lowering the barrier for 950M+ users, it accelerates the transition to multimodal AI, increasing session frequency and establishing the platform as the primary productivity hub in India.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 267 0 R
/Next 528 0 R
>>
